<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vérification de votre email - AgriLink</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f1f5f1;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f1f5f1;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" style="max-width:600px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">

                    {# Logo Header #}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:28px 40px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:3px solid #16a34a;">
                            <img src="{{ absolute_url(asset('logo_with_text.png')) }}" alt="AgriLink" style="height:56px;width:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" />
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    {# Icon Banner #}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#166534;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:50%;width:52px;height:52px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">
                                        <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-top:12px;">
                                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                                        </svg>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="padding-left:14px;text-align:left;">
                                        <p style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Vérification de votre email</p>
                                        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);font-size:13px;">Finaliser votre inscription sur AgriLink</p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    {# Body #}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:36px 40px;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;color:#374151;">Bonjour <strong>{{ user.nom ?? user.email }}</strong>,</p>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 28px;font-size:15px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;">
                                Merci de vous être inscrit sur AgriLink. Pour finaliser votre inscription et sécuriser votre compte, utilisez le code ci-dessous :
                            </p>

                            {# Code block #}
                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:28px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:#f0fdf4;border:2px dashed #16a34a;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;text-align:center;">
                                        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#166534;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;">Votre code de vérification</p>
                                        <p style="margin:0;font-size:40px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.35em;color:#166534;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;">{{ code }}</p>
                                        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" style="margin-top:14px;">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="padding-right:6px;vertical-align:middle;">
                                                    <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="#dc2626" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:block;">
                                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                                                    </svg>
                                                </td>
                                                <td style="font-size:13px;color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;">Ce code expire dans {{ expirationMinutes }} minutes</td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            {# Security notice #}
                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:#fef9c3;border-left:4px solid #eab308;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px 18px;">
                                        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="vertical-align:top;padding-right:10px;padding-top:2px;">
                                                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="#92400e" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:block;flex-shrink:0;">
                                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
                                                    </svg>
                                                </td>
                                                <td style="color:#78350f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
                                                    <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:#92400e;">Conseils de sécurité</strong>
                                                    Ne partagez jamais ce code avec quiconque.<br>
                                                    L'équipe AgriLink ne vous demandera jamais ce code par téléphone.<br>
                                                    Si vous n'avez pas demandé ce code, ignorez cet email.
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    {# Footer #}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#f9fafb;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:20px 40px;text-align:center;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;">Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement par AgriLink.</p>
                            <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;">Si vous n'avez pas créé de compte, ignorez cet email en toute sécurité.</p>
                            <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#d1d5db;">&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} AgriLink — Connecter les agriculteurs tunisiens</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
